{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"2053","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Earnest Matrix Complement"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"5 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"3, 2, 1, ... We are the — RiOI Team!"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"— Felix & All, "},{"children":[{"attrs":{"href":"https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/T351681"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Special Thanks 3"}],"kind":"link"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Peter: Good news: My problem T311013 is approved!"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$\\delta$$$: I'm glad my computer had gone out of battery so that I wouldn't have participated in wyrqwq's round and gained a negative delta."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Felix: [thumbs_up] The problem statement concerning a removed song!"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Aquawave: Do I mourn my Chemistry?"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E.Space: ahh?"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Trine: Bread."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Iris: So why am I always testing problems?"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Time will pass, and we might meet again. Looking back at the past, everybody has lived the life they wanted."}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Aquawave has a matrix $$$A$$$ of size $$$n\\times m$$$, whose elements can only be integers in the range $$$[1, k]$$$, inclusive. In the matrix, some cells are already filled with an integer, while the rest are currently not filled, denoted by $$$-1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are going to fill in all the unfilled places in $$$A$$$. After that, let $$$c_{u,i}$$$ be the number of occurrences of element $$$u$$$ in the $$$i$$$-th row. Aquawave defines the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"beauty"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of the matrix as"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$$$$\\sum_{u=1}^k \\sum_{i=1}^{n-1} c_{u,i} \\cdot c_{u,i+1}.$$$$$$"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have to find the maximum possible beauty of $$$A$$$ after filling in the blanks optimally."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of input contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\leq t \\leq 2\\cdot 10^4$$$) — the number of test cases. The description of test cases follows."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains three integers $$$n$$$, $$$m$$$, and $$$k$$$ ($$$2 \\leq n \\leq 2\\cdot 10^5$$$, $$$2 \\leq m \\leq 2\\cdot 10^5$$$, $$$n \\cdot m \\leq 6\\cdot 10^5$$$, $$$1 \\leq k \\leq n\\cdot m$$$) — the number of rows and columns of the matrix $$$A$$$, and the range of the integers in the matrix, respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then $$$n$$$ lines follow, the $$$i$$$-th line containing $$$m$$$ integers $$$A_{i,1},A_{i,2},\\ldots,A_{i,m}$$$ ($$$1 \\leq A_{i,j} \\leq k$$$ or $$$A_{i,j} = -1$$$) — the elements in $$$A$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n\\cdot m$$$ over all test cases does not exceed $$$6\\cdot 10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output a single integer — the maximum possible beauty."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n9\n3 3 3\n1 2 2\n3 1 3\n3 2 1\n2 3 3\n-1 3 3\n2 2 -1\n3 3 6\n-1 -1 1\n1 2 -1\n-1 -1 4\n3 4 5\n1 3 2 3\n-1 -1 2 -1\n3 1 5 1\n5 3 8\n5 -1 2\n1 8 -1\n-1 5 6\n7 7 -1\n4 4 4\n6 6 5\n-1 -1 5 -1 -1 -1\n-1 -1 -1 -1 2 -1\n-1 1 3 3 -1 -1\n-1 1 -1 -1 -1 4\n4 2 -1 -1 -1 4\n-1 -1 1 2 -1 -1\n6 6 4\n-1 -1 -1 -1 1 -1\n3 -1 2 2 4 -1\n3 1 2 2 -1 -1\n3 3 3 3 -1 2\n-1 3 3 -1 1 3\n3 -1 2 2 3 -1\n5 5 3\n1 1 3 -1 1\n2 2 -1 -1 3\n-1 -1 -1 2 -1\n3 -1 -1 -1 2\n-1 1 2 3 -1\n6 2 7\n-1 7\n-1 6\n7 -1\n-1 -1\n-1 -1\n2 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n4\n10\n10\n8\n102\n93\n58\n13\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, the matrix $$$A$$$ is already determined. Its beauty is"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$$$$\\sum_{u=1}^k \\sum_{i=1}^{n-1} c_{u,i} \\cdot c_{u,i+1} = c_{1,1}\\cdot c_{1,2} + c_{1,2}\\cdot c_{1,3} + c_{2,1}\\cdot c_{2,2} + c_{2,2}\\cdot c_{2,3} + c_{3,1}\\cdot c_{3,2} + c_{3,2}\\cdot c_{3,3} = 1\\cdot 1 + 1\\cdot 1 + 2\\cdot 0 + 0\\cdot 1 + 0\\cdot 2 + 2\\cdot 1 = 4.$$$$$$"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case, one can fill the matrix as follows:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$$$$ \\begin{bmatrix} 2 &3 &3 \\\\ 2 &2 &3 \\end{bmatrix}, $$$$$$"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"and get the value $$$4$$$. It can be proven this is the maximum possible answer one can get."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third test case, one of the possible optimal configurations is:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$$$$ \\begin{bmatrix} 1 &1 &1 \\\\ 1 &2 &1 \\\\ 1 &1 &4 \\end{bmatrix}. $$$$$$"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the fourth test case, one of the possible optimal configurations is:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$$$$ \\begin{bmatrix} 1 &3 &2 &3 \\\\ 1 &3 &2 &1 \\\\ 3 &1 &5 &1 \\end{bmatrix}. $$$$$$"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the fifth test case, one of the possible optimal configurations is:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$$$$ \\begin{bmatrix} 5 &5 &2 \\\\ 1 &8 &5 \\\\ 7 &5 &6 \\\\ 7 &7 &4 \\\\ 4 &4 &4 \\end{bmatrix}. $$$$$$"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"2053F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/2053/problem/F"}